OL,3,GNEWSAOld library to get new focus as
OL,4,Acommunity hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grade II-listed building which was
OL,7,Fhome to a 133-year-old library is to
OL,8,Fget a new lease of life as a community
OL,9,Fhub.
OL,11,FThe red brick Victorian building near
OL,12,FBirmingham city centre, that once
OL,13,Fhoused Spring Hill Library, closed in
OL,14,FDecember 2022 after Birmingham City
OL,15,FCouncil cited issues with the
OL,16,Fbuilding's heating system.
OL,18,FThe Midlands Turkish Society have now
OL,19,Ftaken over the building after it struck
OL,20,Fa deal with the local authority to take
OL,21,Fon a 125-year restricted community-use
OL,22,Flease.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
