OL,3,GNEWSAOld library to get new focus as
OL,4,Acommunity hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe society's chairman, Dr Goktug said
OL,7,Fit planned to turn the building into a
OL,8,F"community hub", including a library
OL,9,Fservice that would continue to operate
OL,10,Fon a "smaller scale".
